    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="57.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 57.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 we willað, þæt man namige on ælcon wæpengetace II triwe þegnas 7 ænne mæssepreost, þæt hi hit gegaderian 7 eft agifan, swa hi durran to swerian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is our will that two trusty thegns and one mass-priest be nominated in each wapentake, to collect it and hand it over, as they dare to swear to it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And we ordain that two trustworthy thegns and one masspriest in each wapentake be chosen to collect it and deliver it again, as they dare to swear to it.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
